{
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "avatar_wan": {
        "name": "Avatar Wan",
        "attack": "<#e8a800ff>Soul of Raava<>: Wan's basic attacks deal <#ff9028ff>100% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0> AD<> as <#a974ffff>50% magic damage<> and <#ff9028ff>50% physical damage<> and apply a different on-hit effect based on the element he is attuned to.",
        "skill": "<#e8a800ff>The Avatar Cycle<>: Wan attunes himself to the next element in-sequence.\n<#ff4d2cff>Fire<>: Burn for <#a974ffff>10 <#ff9028ff>(+10% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0> AD)<> <#a974ffff>(+35% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0> AP)<> magic damage<> over <#e8a800ff>3 seconds<>.\n<#ffe599ff>Air<>: Gain <#ceff99ff>8% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0> attack speed<> for <#e8a800ff>4 seconds<> (max 4 stacks).\n<#3c78d8ff>Water<>: Heal for <#60e84dff>5%<> of your <#60e84dff>missing health<>.\n<#38761dff>Earth<>: Basic attacks deal <#e8a800ff>40%<> of their damage to nearby enemies.",
        "skill2": "<#e8a800ff>Spirit Step<>: Wan dashes a short distance in any direction. For the next <#e8a800ff>4 seconds<>, he stores <#d94c49ff>80% of his damage taken<> and gains <#ffffffff>20% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0> bonus movement speed<>. When <#e8a800ff>Spirit Step<> expires, Wan <#60e84dff>heals himself<> for <#60e84dff>35<> + <#60e84dff>80%<> of the stored damage.",
        "ult": "<#e8a800ff>Harmonic Convergence<>: Wan channels Raava's full power, gaining a <#cab944ff>200 <#a974ffff>(+80% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0> AP)<> <#60e84dff>(+8% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0> HP)<> health shield<> and <#ceff99ff>20% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0> attack speed<> for <#e8a800ff>8 seconds<>. For the duration, Wan's basic attacks apply the effects of <#e8a800ff>all 4 elements<>."
      }
    }
  }
}